                  </h4>
                  <p className="text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed text-white">
                    Showcase your expertise with verified credentials, security clearances, and project portfolios. Connect with verified professionals in satellite operations, microgravity research, and orbital manufacturing.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div className={`p-4 lg:p-6 transition-all duration-1000 ${
                  isSwitching ? 'delay-0' : 'delay-600'
                } ${
                  (leoSectionAnimated || (sectionVisible && scrollEnabled && !isSwitching)) ? 'opacity-100 translate-y-0' : 'opacity-0 translate-y-8'
