                  <h4 className="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-semibold mb-4 text-blue-400">
                    NASA Certifications
                  </h4>
                  <p className="text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed text-white">
                    Access exclusive NASA-backed training programs and certification courses. Advance your career with industry-recognized credentials in space systems, orbital mechanics, and LEO operations.
